510	     * Move a DRAFT, OPEN or PENDING claim to another person on the sheet: it keeps its date, takes the
511	     * next number in the sequence it is numbered in (its old one never used again; a DRAFT gets none), and loses any figure a statement bound it to, its due live again until its new person's
512	     * next statement. Only a role the sheet's permission matrix allows (a steward by
513	     * default) reassigns. Refused when the claim is SETTLED or VOID, when it is
514	     * due by inside a closed period, when the new person is its own, is retired before its date, or (for
515	     * a correction) has no SETTLED claim of the number it corrects.
516	     */
